        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Maruti Suzuki Dzire, Maruti Suzuki Swift Dzire, Swift hatchback\n- Concepts: subcompact sedan, compact car, small family car, mid-size car, C-segment\n- Places: India, North America, Europe\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, the Maruti Suzuki Dzire was introduced in India.\n- The Maruti Suzuki Dzire was earlier known as the Maruti Suzuki Swift Dzire.\n- The Maruti Suzuki Dzire is a subcompact sedan developed as an extension of the Swift hatchback.\n- In North America, a compact car is a car classification larger than a subcompact car and smaller than a mid-size car.\n- In British usage, a compact car is called a small family car.\n- In Europe, the compact car classification is roughly equivalent to the C-segment.",
